  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Effective Responses Against Trafficking and Smuggling in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to contribute to the Indonesian Government&apos;s integrated efforts to investigate perpetrators and networks involved in trafficking in persons and migrant smuggling by increasing access to comprehensive evidence on cross-border trafficking and smuggling trends, building capacity to investigate TIP crimes in line with national laws, and enhancing community-based approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
